{"parentUuid":"c7b39715-6058-4f2d-b7ae-64ee69cef1a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011Ch7L1pQrGSa9tJWCkbyBx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E4VE3o3RMEMQfBxSifNAz5","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review && cat >> p5-list/PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Coordinator review fixes (from the 21:24 screenshots; do these in order with the other items, before the Final item if it is still open)\n\n- [ ] 13. Scope text is cut off. In `selection.png` row 1 reads \"1 selected · 18 lo…\". In compact mode hide the visible \"· N loaded\" part (`.selection-loaded-scope { display: none }` in `list.css`): the loaded count is already shown by \"Select all (18)\" in row 2, and the visually hidden caveat keeps the full scope for screen readers. Rendered assertion at 412×915 and 360×800 after a long-press: the scope paragraph is not clipped (`scrollWidth <= clientWidth`) and its visible text is \"1 selected\". Check: `tests/layout/mobile-list.rendered.test.ts` passes; run the screenshots.\nEOF\ncat >> p5-editor/PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Coordinator review fixes (from the 21:31 screenshots; do these in order with the other items, before the Final item if it is still open)\n\n- [ ] 12. The two editors' X buttons differ. In `compose.png` the X glyph in the new-message header is about 24px; in `reply.png` the reply header's X glyph is about 16px, in a button of the same size. Make both identical: a 48×48 round button with a 24px glyph, sharing one set of selectors in `compose.css` instead of two separate blocks. Rendered assertion in `tests/layout/mobile-compose.rendered.test.ts` at 412×915: the new-message X and the reply X each measure 48×48 (±1) and their `svg` measures 24×24 (±1). Check: that rendered file passes; run the screenshots.\nEOF\n/tmp/claude-1000/-home-exedev-email-os/415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b/scratchpad/p5.sh | head -12","description":"Append two revi