{"parentUuid":"a6bc35ee-f301-40b0-b041-6692d97678d6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"auto_mode","autoModeConsentFlow":false,"finishExposedWork":false,"bashFirst":true,"bashFirstSteer":"relaxed","steerOnly":true,"bypass":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3fecadae-6f6f-4a3b-9b53-1702016cc594","timestamp":"2026-11-17T19:02:00.780Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nWhile bypass permissions mode is active:\n\nYou can do much of your work through the Bash tool when it is the simpler route: read files with cat, head, or sed -n, search with grep and find, and make small, mechanical file changes with sed, heredocs, or short scripts instead of the dedicated Read, Edit, or Write tools. The choice is yours: prefer Edit or Write when a shell edit would be fragile, such as exact or multi-line replacements, or sed/awk flags that differ between GNU and BSD/macOS.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
{"parentUuid":"3fecadae-6f6f-4a3b-9b53-1702016cc594","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"instructions","files":[{"path":"/home/exedev/.claude/CLAUDE.md","type":"User","content":"You are running in an exe.dev VM.\n\nhttps://exe.dev/docs/proxy.md has details about the exe.dev HTTPS proxy.\n\nOnly use documented exe.dev features (see https://exe.dev/docs.md). Undocumented local endpoints are internal infrastructure—unstable and unsupported."},{"path":"/home/exedev/.claude/projects/-home-exedev-email-os/memory/MEMORY.md","type":"AutoMem","content":"- [Maintenance programme](maintenance-programme.md) — 20-ticket refactor I coordinate via Sonnet 5.5 threads (was Sol); merge authority, phase state, machine limits\n- [Shared target stale binary](shared-target-stale-generate-types.md) — check:contract can run another checkout's generate-types; touch lib.rs/generate-types.rs and rerun\n- [Mobile layout programme](mobile-layout-programme.md) — phone layout via GPT-6 Luna threads; scope decisions, mobile/integration branch, phases, emulator setup"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"25dbbd8c-e2d3-4f60-bfca-7a667006dffe","timestamp":"2026-11-17T19:02:01.137Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCodebase and user instructions are shown below. Be sure to adhere to these instructions. IMPORTANT: These instructions OVERRIDE any default behavior and you MUST follow them exactly as written.\n\nContents of /home/exedev/.claude/CLAUDE.md (user's private global instructions for all projects):\n\nYou are running in an exe.dev VM.\n\nhttps://exe.dev/docs/proxy.md has details about the exe.dev HTTPS proxy.\n\nOnly use documented exe.dev features (see https://exe.dev/docs.md). Undocumented local endpoints are internal infrastructure—unstable and unsupported.\n\nContents of /home/exedev/.claude/projects/-home-exedev-email-os/memory/MEMORY.md (user's auto-memory, persists across conversations):\n\n- [Maintenance programme](maintenance-programme.md) — 20-ticket refactor I coordinate via