{"parentUuid":"b3d1a842-22cf-4d2f-b9cd-a2cb954a4a26","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[{"name":"mcp__t3-code__device_list","description":"List iOS Simulators and Android Emulators on every device host, what each host can run, and what is open in this thread's Device panel. Call before `device_open` when you do not know a device id.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"hostId":{"type":"string","description":"Limit to one device host. Defaults to all hosts."}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__device_open","description":"Open a simulator or emulator for this thread. Pass `deviceId` and `hostId` from `device_list`. Boots it if needed and shows it in the user's Device panel. Returns the `agent-device` CLI call pinned to that device. Drive the device with that CLI.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deviceId":{"type":"string"},"platform":{"type":"string","enum":["ios","android"],"description":"Needed with no `deviceId` when both platforms exist."},"hostId":{"type":"string"}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__device_screenshot","description":"Get a PNG of an open device's screen. For taps and text, use the `agent-device` CLI.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deviceId":{"type":"string"},"hostId":{"type":"string"}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__link_pull_request","description":"Link a PR to this thread. T3 shows its status and settles the thread on merge. For several PRs, use `link_pull_requests`.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"},"repository":{"type":"string"},"number":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"With `repository`, when no `url`."},"host":{"type":"string"}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__orchestrator_capabilities","description":"List providers, models, options, and runtime modes for `delegate_task`. Short list. `search` finds others. Any catalog model works.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"search":{"type":"string"}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__t3_background_wait","description":"Keep this thread in Working while background work runs. Pass its task ID once started. Not for work left running (dev server, watcher). `waiting=false` clears. Doesn't stop tasks. Claude/OpenCode only.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"taskIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"maxItems":20},"waiting":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["taskIds"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__t3_thread_launch","description":"Create one new top-level thread, bound to its workspace before the agent starts. Task in `message`. Omit `projectId`, model and modes to inherit yours (outside a thread, pass `projectId` or `scratch`); modes cannot exceed yours. After an error or lost reply, retry with the same `clientRequestId`. Follow it with `t3_thread_read` or `t3_thread_wait`. Mention it with its `link`.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"projectId":{"type":"string"},"scratch":{"type":"boolean","description":"No project: a new Scratch folder. Not with `projectId` or `workspaceStrategy`."},"title":{"type":"string"},"modelSelection":{"type":"object","properties":{"provider":{},"instanceId":{},"model":{},"options":{}},"required":["model"]},"runtimeMode":{"type":"string","enum":["approval-required","auto-accept-edits","auto","full-access"]},"interactionMode":{"type":"string","enum":["default","plan"]},"workspaceStrategy":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","enum":["root","existing_worktree","worktree"]},"branch":{"type":"string"},"worktreePath":{"type":"string"},"baseRef":{"type":"string"},"startFromOrigin":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["type"],"description":"'worktree': new checkout from `baseRef`. Honor a requested base. Otherwise, independent work uses the default branch as `remote/branch` (e.g. `origin/main`) with `startFromOrigin: true`; with no remote, use the local default branch. Required unpublished commits and dependent or stacked work use their local base with `startFromOrigin: false`. 'existing_worktree': bind `worktreePath`, a project worktree. 'root': project checkout, the default, not your worktree. Uncommitted edits are not copied."},"message":{"type":"string","maxLength":120000,"description":"First prompt. Omit it and `attachments` for idle."},"attachments":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","enum":["image","file"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"mimeType":{"type":"string"},"sizeBytes":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":10485760},{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":52428800}]},"source":{"type":"object","properties":{"_tag":{"type":"string","enum":["pasted-text"]}},"required":["_tag"]}},"required":["type","id","name","mimeType","sizeBytes"]},"maxItems":8},"clientRequestId":{"type":"string"},"delegatedFrom":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"title":{"type":"string"}},"required":["environmentId","threadId","title"]}},"required":["title"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__t3_thread_list","description":"List threads newest first, in one project or with `allProjects`. Page with `cursor`.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"projectId":{"type":"string"},"allProjects":{"type":"boolean"},"statuses":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["idle","preparing","queued","starting","running","waiting","completed","interrupted","failed","cancelled","rolled_back"]},"maxItems":10},"titleContains":{"type":"string"},"settled":{"type":"boolean"},"snoozed":{"type":"boolean"},"includeSubagents":{"type":"boolean"},"cursor":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__t3_thread_read","description":"Read any thread by id. View `messages` (default) or `activity` (all items). Newest first; older: `beforePosition=earlierPosition`; from the start: `afterPosition=-1`, then `nextPosition`. Cut-off text: `itemId`, `textOffset=nextTextOffset`. Reading a child's final result marks it delivered. In your reply, name it as its `link` verbatim.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"itemId":{"type":"string"},"textOffset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"view":{"type":"string","enum":["messages","activity"]},"afterPosition":{"type":"integer","minimum":-1},"beforePosition":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Max 100."},"runLimit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Max 50."},"maxCharsPerItem":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Max 20000."}},"required":["threadId"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__t3_thread_send","description":"Send a message to any thread. The target cannot run with broader modes than yours. `mode:'auto'` starts an idle thread, steers a running turn, or queues. `queue`: new turn. `steer`: mid-turn update. `restart`: interrupt and restart. A send to a finished child thread starts a fresh task and returns its `taskId`. In your reply, name it as its `link` verbatim.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"},"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["auto","queue","steer","restart"]},"freshContext":{"type":"boolean","description":"Start a new provider session without the thread's earlier context, like /clear. Never steers."},"clientRequestId":{"type":"string"}},"required":["threadId","message"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__t3_thread_wait","description":"Wait for a thread's run to finish. No `runId`: latest. Idle: at once. On timeout, with `next` end your turn; without, call again.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"runId":{"type":"string"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"number"},"untilDelegatedWorkSettled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Also wait for its delegated and background tasks and their completions to settle. `resultRun` then names the run with its final answer."}},"required":["threadId"]},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__t3_worktree_list","description":"List branch refs and checkout paths for a thread's workspace. Omit `threadId` for this thread. Detached worktrees with no branch are left out.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"query":{"type":"string"},"cursor":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200},"refKind":{"type":"string","enum":["all","local","remote"]},"includeMatchingRemoteRefs":{"type":"boolean"}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__unwatch_pull_request","description":"Stop watching a PR for this thread. It stays linked.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"},"repository":{"type":"string"},"number":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"With `repository`, when no `url`."},"host":{"type":"string"}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true},{"name":"mcp__t3-code__watch_pull_request","description":"Watch an open PR for this thread, linking it first if needed. T3 wakes you on failed checks, passed required checks, new comments or reviews, or conflicts. Handle old comments first. Only later ones wake you. After this call, end your turn. The watch stays on after each wake, so do not call this again on a wake. A wake is not a merge decision. Check readiness yourself.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"environmentId":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"},"repository":{"type":"string"},"number":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"With `repository`, when no `url`."},"host":{"type":"string"}}},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"55ad3e91-c29c-488e-9fd2-9a028e73cb14","timestamp":"2026-11-17T19:02:02.775Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
