ction.png` current and add `selection-with-notice.png` (the state of item 3: a notice showing and one row selected). Run with `EMAIL_OS_SCREENSHOT_DIR=/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/p5-list2`. Check: both files exist in that directory and were rewritten.\n\n- [ ] 5. Final. `pnpm typecheck`, full `pnpm test`, `pnpm build`, the full rendered suite. Update `DESIGN.md` \"Compact layout (phone)\" selection paragraph in one or two sentences (state, not history). Open a pull request from `mobile/p5-list-2` against `mobile/integration` (`gh pr create -R BbrSofiane/email-os --base mobile/integration`), title \"Mobile: selection mode replaces the split pill\", body with what changed and the test counts. Write the URL under this item.\nEOF\nbash /tmp/claude-1000/-home-exedev-email-os/415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b/scratchpad/p5.sh 2>&1 | grep -A1 \"== list\"","description":"Write list follow-up checklist"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch93VLXs4smjZkCUFaMFP","requestRef":"6658efac-04cb-4012-a905-a64f41f690ec","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"388da12b-4502-4d57-8e41-7feec4a473b2","timestamp":"2026-11-17T19:22:02.355Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
