e8cd4-925c-4653-b0d9-de34fd6d26a1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"device_screenshot","type":"assistant","uuid":"a5edff84-97ef-42e0-9346-f6696aa941ed","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:01:17.236Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
{"parentUuid":"a5edff84-97ef-42e0-9346-f6696aa941ed","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"19c7c1cb-127e-449d-958e-f4897e36f0ef","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GkaCpuFZA6YY4cYKu3QFHs","type":"tool_result","content":"@e1 [webview] \"Email OS — Slice 01 Fixture Inbox\"\n@e59 [button] \"Inbox 14\"\nf08fd852be05b942006b1714f561a8aff3c1e02d\n## What this is\n\nA phone layout for the Android fixture build, over features the app already has. The desktop layout is unchanged: everything is compact-only markup or CSS scoped under `.app[data-layout=\"compact\"]` in `src/assets/mobile/`, switched by viewport width (`useLayoutMode`, below 720px). `src/assets/style.css` is not touched.\n\n- **Frame:** top bar, bottom navigation, dark system bars, Android Back following the Escape ladder.\n- **List:** stacked rows, split tabs in a floating pill, navigation drawer, swipe to mark done or remind (with Undo), long-press selection.\n- **Reader:** bottom action bar (star, remind, done, previous, next, more), action sheets, reply bar, per-message menu, contact details, outcome toast.\n- **Editors:** full-screen new message and reply, usable above the software keyboard. Drafts stay local; there is no send path.\n- **Other surfaces:** search, reminders and the reminder picker, drafts, activity, command palette, settings with swipe preferences.\n\nScope decisions are in `docs/adr/0003-mobile-layout.md`; behaviour is in `docs/ux-14-mobile-shell.md`.\n\n## Not included\n\nSend, HTML message bodies, label chips, multiple splits, trash/spam/move actions, reply-all, forward, calendar, AI and voice. Gmail on Android is not part of this; the Android build runs on fixture data.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Frontend unit tests: 1,959 in 118 files (1,897 in 105 on `main`); typecheck and production build pass.\n- Rendered tests in Chromium: 76 of 76 (49 on `main`), including phone geometry at 412×915 and 360×800 and real touch input for swipes and long press.\n- CI on this PR: `check` and `android-apk` pass.\n- Android 15 emulator, locally built debug APK of the merged branch: swipe left to mark done and Undo, swipe right to the reminder picker, long-press selection, reader and action sheet, contact details, a new message typed with the software keyboard up, the saved draft in Drafts, Back closing the reader and then backgrounding the app. Screenshots are in `docs/validation/mobile/`.\n\n## Known issues\n\n- The first launch right after a fresh install can show Android's \"isn't responding\" dialog (also recorded for the original APK in #63). A relaunch is fine.\n- No physical device was used.\n- The Contact page header still shows the word \"Close\" in its round button; the other pages use the glyph.\n\n## How it was built\n\nImplemented in sub-PRs #75, #76, #77, #78, #79 and #81 against this branch by delegated threads, reviewed from screenshots and on the emulator, with conflicts and a few fixes resolved on the branch.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5f4d3610-0161-41cb-8db0-1131d712c440","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:01:19.498Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"@e1 [webview] \"Email OS — Slice 01 Fixture Inbox\"\n@e59 [button] \"Inbox 14\"\nf08fd852be05b942006b1714f561a8aff3c1e02d\n## What this is\n\nA phone layout for the Android fixture build, over features the app already has. The desktop layout is unchanged: everything is compact-only markup or CSS scoped under `.app[data-layout=\"compact\"]` in `src/assets/mobile/`, switched by viewport width (`useLayoutMode`, below 720px). `src/assets/style.css` is not touched.\n\n- **Frame:** top bar, bottom navigation, dark system bars, Android Back following the Escape ladder.\n- **List:** stacked rows, split tabs in a floating pill, navigation drawer, swipe to mark done or remind (with Undo), long-press selection.\n- **Reader:** bottom action bar (star, remind, done, previous, next, more), action sheets, reply bar, per-message menu, contact details, outcome toast.\n- **Editors:** full-screen new message and reply, usable above the software keyboard. Drafts stay local; there is no send path.\n- **Other surfaces:** search, reminders and the reminder picker, drafts, activity, command palette, settings with swipe preferences.\n\nScope decisions are in `docs/adr/0003-mobile-layout.md`; behaviour is in `docs/ux-14-mobile-shell.md`.\n\n## Not included\n\nSend, HTML message bodies, label chips, multiple splits, trash/spam/move actions, reply-all, forward, calendar, AI and voice. Gmail on Android is not part of this; the Android build runs on fixture data.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Frontend unit tests: 1,959 in 118 files (1,897 in 105 on `main`); typecheck and production build pass.\n- Rendered tests in Chromium: 76 of 76 (49 on `main`), including phone geometry at 412×915 and 360×800 and real touch input for swipes and long press.\n- CI on this PR: `check` and `android-apk` pass.\n- Android 15 emulator, locally built debug APK of the merged branch: swipe left to mark done and Undo, swipe right to the reminder picker, long-press selection, reader and action sheet, contact details, a new message typed with the software keyboard up, the saved draft in Drafts, Back closing the reader and then backgrounding the app. Screenshots are in `docs/validation/mobile/`.\n\n## Known issues\n\n- The first launch right after a fresh install can show Android's \"isn't responding\" dialog (also recorded for the original APK in #63). A relaunch is fine.\n- No physical device was used.\n- The Contact page header still shows the word \"Close\" in its round button; the other pages use the glyph.\n\n## How it was built\n\nImplemented in sub-PRs #75, #76, #77, #78, #79 and #81 against this branch by delegated threads, reviewed from screenshots and on the emulator, with conflicts and a few fixes resolved on the branch.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a5edff84-97ef-42e0-9346-f6696aa941ed","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
