{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","prNumber":84,"prUrl":"https://github.com/BbrSofiane/email-os/pull/84","prRepository":"BbrSofiane/email-os","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:31:58.238Z"}
{"parentUuid":"7afcbbbf-a698-415e-b650-a01f150b1f73","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch98r5hJtzu2gUBB9Hpw9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FmsYtXuboUs1RwRx4tgdLG","name":"mcp__t3-code__send_to_user","input":{"message":"## What's working\n- **Truth is the brand.** Draft, search-coverage and outcome wording never overstate what happened. Both reviewers named this independently.\n- **Row anatomy.** Sender 16px, subject 15px, preview 14px, date 13px. Unread shows as both weight and a dot. It holds up on the real device with long subjects and bare addresses.\n- **Commit states.** The armed done swipe turns solid accent with a dark tick; remind stays neutral. Motion is short and switches off with reduced motion. Draft failures keep the text and offer Retry.\n\n## Priority issues\n\n**[P1] A finished action leaves a warning that never goes away.** Both reviewers flagged this. After Undo expires, \"Undo expired — Mark not done restores…\" stays on screen over the reader, search and selection, in amber, with no dismiss. Its \"Mark not done\" points at a different conversation from the one on screen.\n- *Fix:* once a confirmed success's Undo window ends, shrink it to a short neutral line with Dismiss and \"View in Done\". Pending, failed and unknown outcomes stay as they are. This predates the phone work.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable harden`\n\n**[P1] The reader's six action icons have no labels.** Star, clock, tick, up, down and more sit as equals. The tick means \"Mark done\" or \"Mark not done\" depending on context. Up and down move between conversations, not messages.\n- *Fix:* give the done button a visible short label (\"Done\" / \"Not done\").\n- *Option (bigger):* move Star and Previous/Next into More, leaving Done, Remind and More.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable layout`\n\n**[P1] Selection can't be found and doesn't say its scope.** The only way in is a 500ms long-press; the row checkboxes are hidden until then. \"Select all (18)\" hides that it means 18 *loaded* rows. \"Mark 1 done\" is a 40px button next to 48px neighbours.\n- *Fix:* add a visible \"Select\" control.\n- *Fix:* label it \"Select 18 loaded\".\n- *Fix:* make the main button 48px.\n- *A1 also suggests:* a short review sheet before bulk done when more than one row is selected.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable adapt` + `/impeccable clarify`"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4389,"cache_read_input_tokens":273938,"output_tokens":843,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4389,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":843,"cache_read_input_tokens":273938,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4389},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":7388,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FmsYtXuboUs1RwRx4tgdLG":{"message":"## What's working\n- **Truth is the brand.** Draft, search-coverage and outcome wording never overstate what happened. Both reviewers named this independently.\n- **Row anatomy.** Sender 16px, subject 15px, preview 14px, date 13px. Unread shows as both weight and a dot. It holds up on the real device with long subjects and bare addresses.\n- **Commit states.** The armed done swipe turns solid accent with a dark tick; remind stays neutral. Motion is short and switches off with reduced motion. Draft failures keep the text and offer Retry.\n\n## Priority issues\n\n**[P1] A finished action leaves a warning that never goes away.** Both reviewers flagged this. After Undo expires, \"Undo expired — Mark not done restores…\" stays on screen over the reader, search and selection, in amber, with no dismiss. Its \"Mark not done\" points at a different conversation from the one on screen.\n- *Fix:* once a confirmed success's Undo window ends, shrink it to a short neutral line with Dismiss and \"View in Done\". Pending, failed and unknown outcomes stay as they are. This predates the phone work.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable harden`\n\n**[P1] The reader's six action icons have no labels.** Star, clock, tick, up, down and more sit as equals. The tick means \"Mark done\" or \"Mark not done\" depending on context. Up and down move between conversations, not messages.\n- *Fix:* give the done button a visible short label (\"Done\" / \"Not done\").\n- *Option (bigger):* move Star and Previous/Next into More, leaving Done, Remind and More.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable layout`\n\n**[P1] Selection can't be found and doesn't say its scope.** The only way in is a 500ms long-press; the row checkboxes are hidden until then. \"Select all (18)\" hides that it means 18 *loaded* rows. \"Mark 1 done\" is a 40px button next to 48px neighbours.\n- *Fix:* add a visible \"Select\" control.\n- *Fix:* label it \"Select 18 loaded\".\n- *Fix:* make the main button 48px.\n- *A1 also suggests:* a short review sheet before bulk done when more than one row is selected.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable adapt` + `/impeccable clarify`"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch98r1odw2CmsJncftyp9","requestRef":"f053c490-ac2d-459f-8050-2097142f99f8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"send_to_user","type":"assistant","uuid":"24c10863-28cf-4766-8d72-d58622f358a8","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:32:07.559Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
{"parentUuid":"24c10863-28cf-4766-8d72-d58622f358a8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9f6f758c-81e7-4f81-8936-fdb94b5d7a51","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FmsYtXuboUs1RwRx4tgdLG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"sentMessage\":\"## What's working\\n- **Truth is the brand.** Draft, search-coverage and outcome wording never overstate what happened. Both reviewers named this independently.\\n- **Row anatomy.** Sender 16px, subject 15px, preview 14px, date 13px. Unread shows as both weight and a dot. It holds up on the real device with long subjects and bare addresses.\\n- **Commit states.** The armed done swipe turns solid accent with a dark tick; remind stays neutral. Motion is short and switches off with reduced motion. Draft failures keep the text and offer Retry.\\n\\n## Priority issues\\n\\n**[P1] A finished action leaves a warning that never goes away.** Both reviewers flagged this. After Undo expires, \\\"Undo expired — Mark not done restores…\\\" stays on screen over the reader, search and selection, in amber, with no dismiss. Its \\\"Mark not done\\\" points at a different conversation from the one on screen.\\n- *Fix:* once a confirmed success's Undo window ends, shrink it to a short neutral line with Dismiss and \\\"View in Done\\\". Pending, failed and unknown outcomes stay as they are. This predates the phone work.\\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable harden`\\n\\n**[P1] The reader's six action icons have no labels.** Star, clock, tick, up, down and more sit as equals. The tick means \\\"Mark done\\\" or \\\"Mark not done\\\" depending on context. Up and down move between conversations, not messages.\\n- *Fix:* give the done button a visible short label (\\\"Done\\\" / \\\"Not done\\\").\\n- *Option (bigger):* move Star and Previous/Next into More, leaving Done, Remind and More.\\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable layout`\\n\\n**[P1] Selection can't be found and doesn't say its scope.** The only way in is a 500ms long-press; the row checkboxes are hidden until then. \\\"Select all (18)\\\" hides that it means 18 *loaded* rows. \\\"Mark 1 done\\\" is a 40px button next to 48px neighbours.\\n- *Fix:* add a visible \\\"Select\\\" control.\\n- *Fix:* label it \\\"Select 18 loaded\\\".\\n- *Fix:* make the main button 48px.\\n- *A1 also suggests:* a short review sheet before bulk done when more than one row is selected.\\n- *Command:* `/impeccable adapt` + `/impeccable clarify`\",\"message\":\"Shown to the user. Don't repeat it.\"}"}]},"uuid":"7d92f0a3-3d40-4696-8b06-c729676c7177","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:32:07.593Z","toolUseResult":"{\"sentMessage\":\"## What's working\\n- **Truth is the brand.** Draft, search-coverage and outcome wording never overstate what happened. Both reviewers named this independently.\\n- **Row anatomy.** Sender 16px, subject 15px, preview 14px, date 13px. Unread shows as both weight and a dot. It holds up on the real device with long subjects and bare addresses.\\n- **Commit states.** The armed done swipe turns solid accent with a dark tick; remind stays neutral. Motion is short and switches off with reduced motion. Draft failures keep the text and offer Retry.\\n\\n## Priority issues\\n\\n**[P1] A finished action leaves a warning that never goes away.** Both reviewers flagged this. After Undo expires, \\\"Undo expired — Mark not done restores…\\\" stays on screen over the reader, search and selection, in amber, with no dismiss. Its \\\"Mark not done\\\" points at a different conversation from the one on screen.\\n- *Fix:* once a confirmed success's Undo window ends, shrink it to a short neutral line with Dismiss and \\\"View in Done\\\". Pending, failed and unknown outcomes stay as they are. This predates the phone work.\\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable harden`\\n\\n**[P1] The reader's six action icons have no labels.** Star, clock, tick, up, down and more sit as equals. The tick means \\\"Mark done\\\" or \\\"Mark not done\\\" depending on context. Up and down move between conversations, not messages.\\n- *Fix:* give the done button a visible short label (\\\"Done\\\" / \\\"Not done\\\").\\n- *Option (bigger):* move Star and Previous/Next into More, leaving Done, Remind and More.\\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable layout`\\n\\n**[P1] Selection can't be found and doesn't say its scope.** The only way in is a 500ms long-press; the row checkboxes are hidden until then. \\\"Select all (18)\\\" hides that it means 18 *loaded* rows. \\\"Mark 1 done\\\" is a 40px button next to 48px neighbours.\\n- *Fix:* add a visible \\\"Select\\\" control.\\n- *Fix:* label it \\\"Select 18 loaded\\\".\\n- *Fix:* make the main button 48px.\\n- *A1 also suggests:* a short review sheet before bulk done when more than one row is selected.\\n- *Command:* `/impeccable adapt` + `/impeccable clarify`\",\"message\":\"Shown to the user. Don't repeat it.\"}","mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"T3 Code","version":"0.1.10"}},"structuredContent":{"sentMessage":"## What's working\n- **Truth is the brand.** Draft, search-coverage and outcome wording never overstate what happened. Both reviewers named this independently.\n- **Row anatomy.** Sender 16px, subject 15px, preview 14px, date 13px. Unread shows as both weight and a dot. It holds up on the real device with long subjects and bare addresses.\n- **Commit states.** The armed done swipe turns solid accent with a dark tick; remind stays neutral. Motion is short and switches off with reduced motion. Draft failures keep the text and offer Retry.\n\n## Priority issues\n\n**[P1] A finished action leaves a warning that never goes away.** Both reviewers flagged this. After Undo expires, \"Undo expired — Mark not done restores…\" stays on screen over the reader, search and selection, in amber, with no dismiss. Its \"Mark not done\" points at a different conversation from the one on screen.\n- *Fix:* once a confirmed success's Undo window ends, shrink it to a short neutral line with Dismiss and \"View in Done\". Pending, failed and unknown outcomes stay as they are. This predates the phone work.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable harden`\n\n**[P1] The reader's six action icons have no labels.** Star, clock, tick, up, down and more sit as equals. The tick means \"Mark done\" or \"Mark not done\" depending on context. Up and down move between conversations, not messages.\n- *Fix:* give the done button a visible short label (\"Done\" / \"Not done\").\n- *Option (bigger):* move Star and Previous/Next into More, leaving Done, Remind and More.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable clarify` + `/impeccable layout`\n\n**[P1] Selection can't be found and doesn't say its scope.** The only way in is a 500ms long-press; the row checkboxes are hidden until then. \"Select all (18)\" hides that it means 18 *loaded* rows. \"Mark 1 done\" is a 40px button next to 48px neighbours.\n- *Fix:* add a visible \"Select\" control.\n- *Fix:* label it \"Select 18 loaded\".\n- *Fix:* make the main button 48px.\n- *A1 also suggests:* a short review sheet before bulk done when more than one row is selected.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable adapt` + `/impeccable clarify`","message":"Shown to the user. Don't repeat it."}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"24c10863-28cf-4766-8d72-d58622f358a8","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","id":"fef99a82-627c-4532-84ae-aa90475fdf71","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:32:07.638Z","version":"2.1.326","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"910f92d9bd9f283f9ce514220272f6b9ed1f306559080f25290301d617c09838","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"summarized"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"f053c490-ac2d-459f-8050-2097142f99f8","keep":352,"tail":["eb857634c6c00bb6da9e31c49b0b2d1ac8dd217adbe978364d1efa198c2a40b3","0274fa7fa20b889d264075e9b1ccab561df621c4cbe679e92897fe6ad902cc54"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",352,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",353,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"57042a010382bcd885799ca8ef2bb5442b9ca81e537bf4689235baa4863d71b0"}
{"parentUuid":"7d92f0a3-3d40-4696-8b06-c729676c7177","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch98rms2ScYRT3hvW3cKT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FkXP8Th9nA82qXPCyDRPih","name":"mcp__t3-code__send_to_user","input":{"message":"**[P1] Contact never got the phone treatment.**\n- Recent-mail rows are 24px tall.\n- The copy buttons for name and address are 24px and invisible until hover, so they never show on touch.\n- The big name is secretly a \"search this sender\" button.\n- *Fix:* 48px rows, visible 48px copy buttons, and an explicit \"Find mail from sender\" control.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable adapt`\n\n**[P2] Swipe cue and swipe action follow different rules.**\n- A fast fling commits at 64px, well before the 35% point where the row shows it's armed.\n- Real bug: the icon follows the swipe direction, not the action set in Settings. With swipe right set to \"Mark done\", you get a clock icon labelled \"Mark done\".\n- A narrow reveal cuts off the label.\n- *Fix:* show the armed state whenever a release would commit; pick the icon from the action; show the label only once the strip is wide enough.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable harden`\n\n## Persona red flags\n- **Alex (power user):** quick flings act with no cue. \"Select all\" hides \"loaded\". Reminder presets read like paragraphs. The empty command list shows the whole catalogue.\n- **Casey (one-handed):** the menu and compose buttons sit in opposite top corners. Long-press has no visible cue. The bulk button is the smallest target. The notice and selection bar stack over the mail.\n- **Sam (screen reader):** row checkboxes are `display:none` until selection mode, so there's no per-row route in.\n- **Jordan (first-timer):** the reader tick and arrows don't say what they do. The search-results heading is secretly an edit button.\n- **Riley (stress tester):** subjects longer than three lines are silently cut off in the reader (`max-height: 4.5em`). The X/save path with a real keyboard and a failure is untested on a device."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1710,"cache_read_input_tokens":278327,"output_tokens":1320,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1710,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1320,"cache_read_input_tokens":278327,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1710,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1710},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":6546,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FkXP8Th9nA82qXPCyDRPih":{"message":"**[P1] Contact never got the phone treatment.**\n- Recent-mail rows are 24px tall.\n- The copy buttons for name and address are 24px and invisible until hover, so they never show on touch.\n- The big name is secretly a \"search this sender\" button.\n- *Fix:* 48px rows, visible 48px copy buttons, and an explicit \"Find mail from sender\" control.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable adapt`\n\n**[P2] Swipe cue and swipe action follow different rules.**\n- A fast fling commits at 64px, well before the 35% point where the row shows it's armed.\n- Real bug: the icon follows the swipe direction, not the action set in Settings. With swipe right set to \"Mark done\", you get a clock icon labelled \"Mark done\".\n- A narrow reveal cuts off the label.\n- *Fix:* show the armed state whenever a release would commit; pick the icon from the action; show the label only once the strip is wide enough.\n- *Command:* `/impeccable harden`\n\n## Persona red flags\n- **Alex (power user):** quick flings act with no cue. \"Select all\" hides \"loaded\". Reminder presets read like paragraphs. The empty command list shows the whole catalogue.\n- **Casey (one-handed):** the menu and compose buttons sit in opposite top corners. Long-press has no visible cue. The bulk button is the smallest target. The notice and selection bar stack over the mail.\n- **Sam (screen reader):** row checkboxes are `display:none` until selection mode, so there's no per-row route in.\n- **Jordan (first-timer):** the reader tick and arrows don't say what they do. The search-results heading is secretly an edit button.\n- **Riley (stress tester):** subjects longer than three lines are silently cut off in the reader (`max-height: 4.5em`). The X/save path with a real keyboard and a failure is untested on a device."}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch98ri36XpqcyR9AJww9i","requestRef":"fef99a82-627c-4532-84ae-aa90475fdf71","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"send_to_user","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c6d6539-6f0e-4946-aac4-d2d195eb69c6","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:32:15.936Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
