{"parentUuid":"cf7484e2-2ee8-4144-ae42-f2b62d01194c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch99r8KRoTB3WKnmXKFKB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm planning to run these as threads on the gpt-6.2-sol model, with effort unspecified so it defaults to low, though I'm leaning toward high for the implementation threads since Luna used that. I'm weighing whether to launch them as top-level threads with t3_thread_launch, as I did before with worktrees, given that the user wants the steps split across threads.\n\nI'm weighing the three-thread split: T1 takes the notice and swipe work, T2 the reader label and contact pane, and T3 the selection bar, with T3 waiting until one of the first two finishes because they overlap on the list files and the machine only runs two threads at once. I'll also check whether a GPT-6.2-Astra model is available, since the capabilities list only showed the Sol and 6.1 variants.\n\nI'm going to finish the polish step with a review and a short list of small fixes, then get critiques from three subagents: GPT-6.2-Astra, GPT-6.2-Sol, and Opus 5.5. First I need to confirm whether Astra is actually available, so I'm checking the capabilities list for it now.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1098,"cache_read_input_tokens":286834,"output_tokens":723,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":658},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1098,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":723,"cache_read_input_tokens":286834,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1098,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1098},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":nul