{"parentUuid":"e6ac4e12-ba9d-4b50-87ab-cbf583a2b2ea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch99tnepscYDKnWg25EAd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking whether the labelled \"Done\" button fits in the compact dock: about 63px per slot at 412px width, and the other buttons can shrink to 48px. At the 360px width it gets tighter, with 328px available.\n\nI'm settling where the Select control goes: the top bar has room in the middle, so I'm leaning toward a 48px select button beside compose whenever the view is a list, with the three threads split across files as planned.\n\nI'm weighing where the Select control should live and settling on a compact-only button in the top bar beside compose, with a checkbox-style glyph and an \"aria-label\" for screen readers. I also need to decide what selection mode looks like when nothing is selected yet, since right now it only exists once a row is chosen.\n\nI'm going with high reasoning effort for the new thread, since the default low didn't suit the earlier one. I'll have it work through the whole checklist in one turn, committing and pushing after each item, with nudges if it stalls. Next I'm loading the schema for launching the thread in a worktree from the integration branch.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3864,"cache_read_input_tokens":295550,"output_tokens":1159,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1067},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3864,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1159,"cache_read_input_tokens":295550,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3864,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3864},"type":"