{"parentUuid":"39a6e197-c04b-4a91-9c59-f9e481da615e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"193670e2-db32-4faf-964f-dd1235e3838c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SdnbqC8toj1Smxb9LXD8bE","type":"tool_result","content":"21:16:15\n== p6-notice-swipe: 9 ticked, 0 open\n  Decision: Verified typecheck, build, 2,030 unit and integration tests, 90 Chromium tests, and 30 screenshots before opening the integration PR.\n  [Pull request #87](https://github.com/BbrSofiane/email-os/pull/87)\n== p6-reader-contact: 5 ticked, 2 open\n  Decision: Used wrapping identity fields beside visible 48px copy targets and separated the wrapping recent-mail rows with the shared rule color.\n  Decision: Made the compact name plain text and put the sender-search button below the identity fields. Verified it opens the sender results and refreshed contact.png.\n== p6-selection: 6 ticked, 3 open\n  Decision: Made every bar button at least 48px high, allowed wrapping, and captured all three selection states.\n  Decision: Clipped the native labelled checkbox to 1px and removed pointer hit-testing until selection opens.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fe48a4db-a470-4a36-8447-0c0a52e6951e","timestamp":"2026-11-17T21:16:15.436Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"21:16:15\n== p6-notice-swipe: 9 ticked, 0 open\n  Decision: Verified typecheck, build, 2,030 unit and integration tests, 90 Chromium tests, and 30 screenshots before opening the integration PR.\n  [Pull request #87](https://github.com/BbrSofiane/email-os/pull/87)\n== p6-reader-contact: 5 ticked, 2 open\n  Decision: Used wrapping identity fields beside visible 48px copy targets and separated the wrapping recent-mail rows with the shared rule color.\n  Decision: Made the compact name plain text and put the sender-search button below the identity fields. Verified it opens the sender results and refreshed contact.png.\n== p6-selection: 6 ticked, 3 open\n  Decision: Made every bar button at least 48px high, allowed wrapping, a