{"parentUuid":"a4b70797-774b-4429-81c6-8d1be3ccfc78","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9DcveKGc7YtvShJ6vKc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011AQTU4ymvkjeRH3QuyshsA","name":"mcp__t3-code__delegate_task","input":{"title":"Critique r3 B (GPT-6.2-Astra): detector","role":"review","target":{"providerInstanceId":"codex","model":"gpt-6.2-astra","options":{"reasoningEffort":"high"}},"clientRequestId":"crit-r3-b","task":"You run Assessment B (deterministic detector + browser evidence) of an \"Impeccable critique\" of a phone UI. Read `/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/critique-r3/COMMON.md` first and follow it (read-only repo, where to write). You do not do a subjective design review; you collect and triage detector evidence. Do not request escalated permissions; run commands directly, and keep any temporary files inside `/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/critique-r3/`.\n\nTool: the Impeccable launcher at `/home/exedev/.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/impeccable`. Run it with cwd `/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-validate`. Rendered scans need `IMPECCABLE_BROWSER=/tmp/chrome-rendered/chrome/linux-156.0.8078.80/chrome-linux64/chrome`. Run `.../impeccable detect --help` first for the exact flags (it supports `--viewport WxH`).\n\nSteps:\n1. Source scan: `impeccable detect --json src/components src/App.vue` (markup only). Exit 0 = clean, 2 = findings. Record counts per rule and file:line.\n2. Rendered scan of the phone layout. `dist/` was built from this commit; if it is missing or older than `src/`, run `pnpm build` (writes only `dist/`, allowed). Start `npx vite preview --port 4873 --strictPort` in the background so it survives your command (for example `nohup … &` inside a shell that then waits on a readiness check), record its PID, and scan `http://localhost:4873/` with `--viewport 412x915`. If the detector can only scan the landing state (the inbox), say so. Stop the preview server before you finish and confirm the port is closed.\n3. Do not attempt a live overlay or human-browser injection; report \"overlay not available: headless environment\".\n4. Triage every finding: true issue, false positive (with reason: off-screen or inert desktop-only markup; harness chrome such as the top account-tab strip and yellow \"Preview\" label; text that sits under the floating bottom bars only at the sampled scroll position), or advisory. Check each against `src/assets/mobile/` and the screenshots in `/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/critique-r3/browser/`.\n\nReturn: CLI findings (counts, rule names, file locations), rendered findings (counts, rules, selectors, viewport), the triage table, and skipped/failed steps with the concrete reason and command output. Write it to `/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/critique-r3/B-detector.md` (raw JSON next to it) and return it as your final message. Do not delegate, do not edit the repository."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1137,"cache_read_input_tokens":422650,"output_tokens":2588,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":48},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1137,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2588,"cache_read_input_tokens":422650,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1137,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1137},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":8543,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_011AQTU4ymvkjeRH3QuyshsA":{"title":"Critique r3 B (GPT-6.2-Astra): detector","role":"review","target":{"providerInstanceId":"codex","model":"gpt-6.2-astra","options":{"reasoningEffo