{"parentUuid":"6bd938be-e45b-4474-9727-f5db3a21b08c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9ECLUC1QU1AVSaFnpyZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017y2TqtKKHS8Edb2q42G7SU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"B=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-exedev-email-os/415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b/scratchpad/pr80-body.md; gh pr view 80 -R BbrSofiane/email-os --json body -q .body > $B.orig; python3 - \"$B\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p+'.orig').read()\ns=s.replace(\"## Not included\",\"\"\"## Round 3: second critique fixes\n\nA second critique (three GPT-6.1-SOL reviewers) scored 25/40 and named four P1s and a swipe P2; all are addressed:\n\n- **Finished actions end quietly (#87):** on the phone, a confirmed action's notice leaves when its Undo window ends instead of staying on every screen with \"Undo expired…\". Pending, failed and unknown outcomes stay; failed or unknown ones get an \"Activity\" button.\n- **Swipes (#87):** the armed cue now uses the same rule as the commit, so a fast fling shows it too; the icon and colour follow the action chosen in Settings, not the swipe direction; the label appears only once the strip is wide enough.\n- **Reader (#88):** the done button shows a visible \"Done\" / \"Not done\" label next to its tick; the other five controls are unchanged.\n- **Contact (#88):** 48px recent-mail rows, always-visible 48px copy buttons, and a visible \"Find mail from sender\" action (the name is no longer a hidden button).\n- **Selection (#89):** a Select button in the top bar enters selection mode with nothing selected; the bar reads \"1 of 18 selected\" and \"Select 18 loaded\"; every bar button is at least 48px; row checkboxes stay reachable by screen readers outside selection mode. Long-press still works.\n\n## Not included\"\"\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"- Frontend unit tests: 2,004 in 122 files\",\"- Frontend unit tests: 2,042 in 122 files\")\ns=s.replace(\"- Rendered tests in Chromium: 82 passed, 6 skipped (the screenshot capture and opt-in files), including phone geometry at 412×915 and 360×800 and real touch input for swipes and long press. One run in five had a single failure that did not reproduce in four reruns; I did not identify the test.\",\"- Rendered tests in Chromium: 86 passed, 6 skipped (the screenshot capture and opt-in files), including phone geometry at 412×915 and 360×800 and real touch input for swipes and long press. A race in the swipe test that caused an occasional failure last round was fixed in #87.\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"- After an action's Undo window ends, its notice stays on screen (\"Undo expired — Mark not done restores…\") over the list and reader until the next action. This behaviour predates this PR and was not changed.\n\"\"\",\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"Round 2 was re-checked on the emulator with a local APK of f08fd85\",\"Round 2 was re-checked on the emulator with a local APK of f08fd85, and round 3 with ac939a3 (Select button and empty selection mode, one row selected, Back clearing selection, labelled Done in the reader, Contact, a swipe to mark done whose notice left when Undo ended)\")\ns=s.replace(\"#82, #83, #84, #85 and #86\",\"#82–#86, and for round 3, #87, #88 and #89\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ndiff $B.orig $B | grep -c '^>'; gh pr edit 80 -R BbrSofiane/email-os --body-file $B >/dev/null && echo updated; gh pr checks 80 -R BbrSofiane/email-os 2>&1 | head -3","description":"Update PR 80 description for round 3 and check CI"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10921,"cache_read_input_tokens":427797,"output_tokens":1473,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":107},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10921,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global"