{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-17T21:42:34.890Z","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","content":"Delegated task node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3Aff073a25-60a1-40e6-9d21-12438e4be376%3Adelegate-task%3Acrit-r3-b (Critique r3 B (GPT-6.2-Astra): detector) [completed]:\n[Assessment B report and complete triage table](/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/critique-r3/B-detector.md)\n\nThe **412 × 915 inbox scan** produced 22 warnings. Eighteen `tight-leading` findings trace to one shared style. All 18 conversation previews use 1.25× line height, below the detector’s 1.3× threshold. The four `text-occlusion` findings were false positives for persistent obstruction. The floating controls cover text at the sampled scroll position, and the end-of-list screenshot confirms the final preview scrolls clear. [Raw rendered JSON](/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/critique-r3/B-rendered.json)\n\nThe **source scan** exited 0 with one advisory. `design-system-radius` flagged the startup card’s 8px radius. [FixtureTransitionGate.vue:115](/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-validate/src/components/FixtureTransitionGate.vue:115) · [Raw source JSON](/home/exedev/email-os-mobile-review/critique-r3/B-source.json)\n\nRendered coverage was limited to the landing inbox. The preview server was stopped and port 4873 was confirmed closed.\n\noverlay not available: headless environment\n\nDelegated task node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3Aff073a25-60a1-40e6-9d21-12438e4be376%3Adelegate-task%3Acrit-r3-a1 (Critique r3 A1 (GPT-6.2-SOL): list surfaces) [completed]. Use task_status with taskId node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3Aff073a25-60a1-40e6-9d21-12438e4be376%3Adelegate-task%3Acrit-r3-a1 to read the result."}
