{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","prNumber":84,"prUrl":"https://github.com/BbrSofiane/email-os/pull/84","prRepository":"BbrSofiane/email-os","timestamp":"2026-11-17T21:42:38.063Z"}
{"parentUuid":"064f27fc-6514-4c77-83d5-a6f111a186e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9EEfrp7dMXydD2SyUkU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm combining the two scores, which both come to 25, and averaging each heuristic's pair of ratings, with the ones that agree landing at 3 or 2.\n\nSettling on the integer scores per heuristic, I'm giving the ones that match up a 2 or 3 and checking the total adds back to 25. That holds, but the review is still flat at 25: the old problems stayed fixed, while the reviewers raised new ones and judged the changes critically.\n\nI'm going to check five of the reviewers' new claims against the code: whether disabled reader controls really look identical to enabled ones, whether a failed swipe-action settings save leaves the radio checked, whether swiping is blocked during selection mode, whether a fling commits at 64px before the label appears at 128px, and whether an empty draft gets discarded when closed.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8892,"cache_read_input_tokens":441205,"output_tokens":1055,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":767},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8892,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1055,"cache_read_input_tokens":441205,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8892,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8892},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9059,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch9EEZFCH9DWK7hsV7qQN","requestRef":"c686f1ec-7bd9-48a1-a2d8