b; palette Mark done target unnamed. Casey: top-corner Menu/Select/X; Reply pill 12px above Star; no Copy text confirmation; silent disappearance. Sam: selection hides read-state cue; selected-row paperclip ~2.75:1; clipped checkbox focusable. Jordan: Done as status; Unread persists, Mark read in More; placeholder as query. Riley: reader subject clipped at 3 lines (reader.css:9-17, repeat); toast label unclamped; Copy text failure only greys the row.\n\n## Minor observations\nPreview leading 1.25; lavender 3-4x per reader screen; radios browser blue; settings note louder than parent; 60-option minute select; More sheet dividers (Files and links no group, App.vue:898); reply quote \"Plain text only.…\"; Refresh reminders reads as text; Contact recent rows no dates; drawer index===8, no close; palette 9 commands; reminder picker verbose/out of order, Schedule disabled until Enter; dock height not in scroll clearance (inferred).\n\n## Questions\nUnread word as the Mark read control? Down-chevron instead of X? Do Previous/Next earn two dock slots?\nEOF\nIMPECCABLE_CRITIQUE_META='{\"target\":\"phone layout key screens (src/assets/mobile)\",\"total_score\":25,\"max_score\":40,\"na_heuristics\":\"\",\"p0_count\":0,\"p1_count\":4}' /home/exedev/.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/impeccable critique-storage write src/assets/mobile $S/crit3-body.md 2>&1 | tail -1; rm -f $S/crit3-body.md; /home/exedev/.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/impeccable critique-storage trend src/assets/mobile 5 2>&1 | grep -oE '\"total_score\": ?[0-9]+' | tr '\\n' ' '","description":"Persist round-3 critique snapshot and read trend"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch9EJzfXGanYE2MRqDf9w","requestRef":"4e5aa585-5464-46bb-8efd-95f24666adc0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"send_to_user","type":"assistant","uuid":"11e50fc4-e2f7-4467-98aa-6cdb2b0519f8","timestamp":"2026-11-17T21:43:54.643Z","advisorModel":"claude-o